    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last updated: April 30, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>Geo Game is an educational geography game. This privacy policy explains how we handle user information.</p>

    <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Player name:</strong> Optional, only used to display local rankings.</p>
    <p><strong>Scores:</strong> Stored locally on the device to display personal records.</p>
    <p><strong>Device data:</strong> Basic technical information used to display advertisements.</p>

    <h2>3. Advertisements</h2>
    <p>We use Google Mobile Ads to display advertisements. Google may collect device identifiers according to its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>4. Children Under 13</h2>
    <p>Geo Game is designed for all ages. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 years old.</p>

    <h2>5. Storage</h2>
    <p>All data (player name and scores) is stored <strong>only on the device</strong>, not on our servers.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related questions: contact the application creator.</p>

